        },
        {
          "text": "Neijia eiko Enkiyang'et pee elotu aretu iyiook te nchalan ang; amu aimikiyiolo iyiook aajo ainyoo kiomonu nimikiyiolo enikijo ti nikiomonu, kake Enkiyang'et makewan naomonoki iyiook te mion nagut nemeinosunoyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ilo laa ninye ojur iltauja neyiolo ninye enajo Enkiyang'et, amu Enkai nayieu neaku enkiyang'et nanyikaki ninye too mbaa oo ltung'ana lenyena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikiyiolo aajo ore te pooki toki neasisho Enkai too mbaa supati te lelo oonyor ninye, te lelo oo ipotoki te risioroto e yieuna enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu etayiolo apake Enkai ilenyena negelu metotiutu anaa ilo Inoti lenye, pee eaku ilo Inoti olkikau loo lalashera kumok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore lelo ooidipa ninye ategelu, neiteng'el; ore lelo ooiteng'ela ninye neipot, ore lelo ooipoto neikenaki esipata, ore lelo ooikenaka esipata neisho ake sii enkitoo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enyorrata e Nkai tiatua Kristo Yesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaa naa kijo te na? Amaa te netii Enkai enkalo ang, kalo oidim atigilunore iyiook? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eitu eibooyo ninye ilo Inoti lenye kake eishorua ninye te nkaraki iyiook pooki. Amaa etaasa ina, ainyoo ae naitoki amitiki ninye, eisho iyiook pooki toki pesho?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ae ng'ae oitoki aitang'or ilgelunot le Nkai? Mme Enkai, amu ninye makewan naishoo ninche isipat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ae ng'ae naa odung'oki ninche enkiguana? Ae Kristo Yesu otua, oonyaaka apiu aing'uaa keeya, netii taata, enkaina e tatene e Nkai, nesipa nchere ninye oomonoki iyiook. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ainyoo naidim atirishie iyook enyorrata e Kristo? Keidim ingolikinot, anaa emion, anaa enkisilisiloto? Anaa olameyu, anaa enikipuo mikinchopo, anaa batisho, anaa enkeeya o anaa olalem? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.44.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Olke 44.22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ejo Ilkigerot oojo: “Ore te nkaraki iyie earitai iyiook dama o kewarie matuata; kitotiutuo anaa noshi tare naapuoi aayieng.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A'a, ore te kuna pooki kisulie kimirisho aaisulie te nkaraki ilo otonyorra iyiook. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu aitisipa nanu nchere mme keeya, neme enkishui, neme ilmalaika, neme engolon e naimin, ne ntokitin naatii, ne ntokitin naapuonu neme nkitoriat neme enguton, neme ae toki to seuseu pooki, naidim atirishie iyiook enyorrata e Nkai natii Kristo Yesu Olaitoriani lang. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neme kulie kiyang'eta o loing'ang'e, aashu naatii olodo le nkop, neme hoo ae toki natii enkop o loing'ang'e pooki naidim atirishie iyiook enyorrata e Nkai natii Kristo Yesu Olaitoriani lang.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
